#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>In such situation, feel free to experiment with this database and "
"then to create a new one for your own usage.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງສ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ສຳລັບກາ"
"ນນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຈິງຂອງທ່ານເອງ.</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Multiple resource blocking / period closure</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການປິດກັ້ນຫຼາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ / ການປິດຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Shared offers</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຮ່ວມ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Single resource blocking</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການປິດກັ້ນຊັບພະຍາກອນດຽວ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Use case</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"A price at 0 combined with the setting \"Hide Add To Cart\" prevents "
"bookings from your website!"
msgstr ""
"ລາຄາ 0 ບວກກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Hide Add To Cart\" ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການຈອງຜ່ານໜ້າເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_13
msgid "A-frame Cabin"
msgstr "ຕູບໄມ້ຊົງສາມຫຼ່ຽມ (A-frame)"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Access the rates from the same menu to see how price rules apply during the "
"year."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເບິ່ງອັດຕາລາຄາຈາກເມນູດຽວກັນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວິທີນຳໃຊ້ກົດເກນລາຄາໃນຕະຫຼອດປີ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Access to more details clicking the slot."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໂດຍການກົດໃສ່ຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid ""
"Accommodation were exactly what we needed for a family moment.<br/>Many "
"thanks agan."
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນພັກແມ່ນຕອບໂຈດທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ເຮົາຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາຂອງຄອບຄົວ.<br/>ຂອບໃຈຫຼາຍໆອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add here as many of them as needed."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຈຳນວນລາຍການໃສ່ບ່ອນນີ້ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust the number of stars, leave a comment and send it!"
msgstr "ປັບຈຳນວນດາວ, ຂຽນຄຳຄິດເຫັນ ແລ້ວກົດສົ່ງເລີຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Adjust the rental dates, click the book button and then proceed to checkout."
msgstr "ປັບວັນທີເຊົ່າພັກ, ກົດປຸ່ມຈອງ ແລ້ວດຳເນີນການຊຳລະເງິນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust your prices along the year"
msgstr "ປັບລາຄາຂອງທ່ານຕາມລະດູການໃນຮອບປີ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjusting your offers in consequence"
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນຂໍ້ສະເໜີຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Again, the <strong>Holiday House App </strong>helps you manage the end of "
"the stay!"
msgstr ""
"ອີກຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງ, <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ </strong>ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຂັ້ນຕອນສິ້ນສຸດການພັກເຊົາໄດ້"
"ງ່າຍດາຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.custom_product_name
msgid "All Houses"
msgstr "ເຮືອນພັກທັງໝົດ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively to individual resource blocking slots described earlier, you "
"can select a resource this leave applies to."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການປິດກັ້ນຊ່ອງເວລາຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນແຕ່ລະອັນດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍຜ່ານມາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກຊັບພະ"
"ຍາກອນທີ່ການລາພັກນີ້ມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, which is more suitable if the "
"booking is not during the visualized date range and update the booking date "
"range."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປເປັນມຸມມອງລາຍການ (List view) ເຊິ່ງຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າ ຖ້າຫາກການຈອງບໍ່ໄ"
"ດ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງວັນທີທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຜົນຢູ່, ແລ້ວອັບເດດຊ່ວງວັນທີຈອງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type in the search bar and select the appropriate filter."
msgstr "ຫຼື ພິມລົງໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ ແລ້ວເລືອກຕົວກັ່ນຕອງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can create a slot as placeholder from the planning "
"directly:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາໄວ້ກ່ອນ ຈາກໜ້າຕາຕະລາງແຜນງານໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ:"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid ""
"Amazing stay at the heart of a pine tree forest. Resourcing and peaceful. "
"<br/>Lovely furnished with all the necessary, even including games such as "
"Mölkky. <br/>I can only recommend!"
msgstr ""
"ການພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ຍອດຢ້ຽມທ່າມກາງປ່າສົນ. ຮູ້ສຶກຜ່ອນຄາຍ ແລະ ສະຫງົບສຸກ. <br/>ຕົກແຕ່ງຢ່າງໜ້າຮັກພ້ອມສິ່ງອຳນວຍ"
"ຄວາມສະດວກຄົບຊຸດ, ແຖມຍັງມີເກມຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ Mölkky. <br/>ແນະນຳເລີຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:holiday_house.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:holiday_house.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:holiday_house.product_template_14
msgid "An address must be specified for a map to be embedded"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ ເພື່ອຝັງແຜນທີ່ລົງໃນໜ້າເວັບ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Anyone can create a portal account on your database.<br/>\n"
"Open your website home page in a private tab to do so."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກຄົນສາມາດສ້າງບັນຊີປະຕູເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Portal) ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້.<br/>\n"
"ເປີດໜ້າທຳອິດຂອງເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານໃນແຖບສ່ວນຕົວ (Private tab) ເພື່ອລອງເຮັດເບິ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Assign them a resource, which helps you keeping track."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊັບພະຍາກອນໃຫ້ແກ່ລາຍການດັ່ງກ່າວ ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕາມໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time from the guest order, use the Send message capability in the "
"chatter to exchange with your guest."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໃນຊ່ອງສົນທະນາ ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບແຂກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ ຈາກໃບສັ່ງຂອງ"
"ແຂກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time you can adjust the city tax count delivered by re-opening the "
"city tax widget clicking the City Tax button on the guest order."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຈຳນວນອາກອນເມືອງທີ່ສົ່ງມອບໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ ໂດຍການເປີດ widget ອາກອນເມືອງຄືນໃໝ່ ຜ່ານກ"
"ານກົດປຸ່ມ ອາກອນເມືອງ (City Tax) ຢູ່ເທິງໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_14
msgid "Beach House"
msgstr "ເຮືອນພັກແຄມຫາດຊາຍ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Because keeping an eye on your business performance matter, the module comes "
"with a dedicated dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້ອນວ່າການຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງທຸລະກິດມີຄວາມສຳຄັນ, ໂມດູນນີ້ຈຶ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບແຜງຄວບຄຸມສະເພາະ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Beyond daily operations, the Steering menu serves as the \"Captain’s "
"Bridge\" of your holiday houses. It provides a 500-day horizon to anticipate "
"market trends, manage risks, and optimize your revenue."
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກການດຳເນີນງານປະຈຳວັນ, ເມນູ Steering ປຽບເໝືອນ \"ຫ້ອງບັນຊາການ\" ຂອງເຮືອນພັກຕາກອ"
"າກາດຂອງທ່ານ. ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລ່ວງໜ້າເຖິງ 500 ວັນ ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນທ່າອ່ຽງຂອງຕະຫຼາດ, ຈັດການຄວາມສ່"
"ຽງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມລາຍຮັບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສູງສຸດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Blocking resources"
msgstr "ການປິດກັ້ນຊັບພະຍາກອນ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Booking a house"
msgstr "ການຈອງເຮືອນພັກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Odoo ຈະນຳເອົາອາກອນ ແລະ ສະຖານະທາງອາກອນເຂົ້າສູ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຕັ້ງ. "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການຂາຍໃຫ້ຕ່າງປະເທດ, ແຕ່ອາດຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"
"ເພີ່ມເຕີມເລັກນ້ອຍ ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນກັບລູກຄ້າຕ່າງປະເທດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products, sale orders and more."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໂມດູນນີ້ແລ້ວ, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກປ້ອນດ້ວຍສິນຄ້າ, ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ຈຳນ"
"ວນໜຶ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "ຄິດໄລ່ເກັບເງິນລູກຄ້າຕາມຈຳນວນເງິນດັ່ງກ່າວ ແລ້ວກໍເປັນອັນສຳເລັດ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "ເກັບເງິນຄ່າບໍລິການຈາກແຂກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guest who stayed in each room. Then "
"confirm the number of city tax to be charged, which updated the delivered "
"city tax count."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ ແລະ ປັບປ່ຽນຈຳນວນແຂກທີ່ພັກໃນແຕ່ລະຫ້ອງຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. ຈາກນັ້ນຢືນຢັນຈຳນວນອາກອນເມືອງທີ່ຈະຮ"
"ຽກເກັບ, ເຊິ່ງຈະອັບເດດຈຳນວນອາກອນເມືອງທີ່ສົ່ງມອບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "ແຈ້ງແຂກເຂົ້າພັກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "ແຈ້ງແຂກອອກຈາກທີ່ພັກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ ແລ້ວກົດຢືນຢັນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"ອາກອນເມືອງຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຮຽກເກັບຕາມຈຳນວນຄືນທີ່ເຂົ້າພັກຕົວຈິງ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕາມທິດສະດີ, ແລະ ຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຜົນລວມຂອ"
"ງຈຳນວນຄືນທີ່ແຂກແຕ່ລະຄົນໄດ້ພັກເຊົາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the house to book."
msgstr "ກົດເລືອກເຮືອນພັກຫຼັງໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຈອງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ ແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າແຂກໄດ້ມາຮອດ ແລະ ເຂົ້າພັກຢູ່ສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ ແຈ້ງອອກ ເພື່ອບັນທຶກວ່າແຂກໄດ້ສົ່ງມອບກະແຈຄືນແລ້ວ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "ກົດ ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງ (Create Order) ເພື່ອເປີດແບບຟອມໃບສັ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Invoice button with a full invoice."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ (Invoice) ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Pay with demo button, and then Pay button to mimic the payment."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ Pay with demo, ແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມ Pay ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການຊຳລະເງິນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the tail of the corresponding booking and drag it to the requested "
"date."
msgstr "ກົດໃສ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງການຈອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລ້ວລາກໄປຫາວັນທີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave selecting the appropriate working schedule, the one from "
"your stay resources."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການລາພັກໃໝ່ໂດຍເລືອກຕາຕະລາງການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນບ່ອນພັກຂອງ"
"ທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave the same way as previously, but this time specify the "
"resource this applies to."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການລາພັກໃໝ່ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ແຕ່ຮອບນີ້ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Created offers are assigned no company nor branch (default behavior).<br/>As "
"a result, they are available from all companies and branches, as well as all "
"websites from those."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາໃດໜຶ່ງ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).<br/>ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ສະເໜີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສາມາດ"
"ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຈາກທຸກໆ ບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ, ລວມທັງເວັບໄຊທັງໝົດຂອງບໍລິສັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Define start and end date time and save your leave."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວັນທີ-ເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດ ແລ້ວບັນທຶກການລາພັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "ຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Odoo ໂດຍການເຂົ້າເບິ່ງ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Discover the basics of this package and explore all the possibilities Odoo "
"offers to improve your experience."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽນຮູ້ພື້ນຖານຂອງແພັກເກດນີ້ ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາທຸກຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ Odoo ມອບໃຫ້ ເພື່ອຍົກລະດັບປະສົບການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to replicate the Booking Blocker rule on all your pricelists "
"and to specify the website this applies to.<br/>On a regular basis postpone "
"this booking blocker start date season after season to unlock your calendar."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມນຳໃຊ້ກົດເກນປິດກັ້ນການຈອງ (Booking Blocker) ນີ້ໄປໃສ່ທຸກໆ ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ລະບຸເ"
"ວັບໄຊທີ່ນຳໃຊ້.<br/>ຄວນເລື່ອນວັນທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການປິດກັ້ນການຈອງນີ້ອອກໄປເລື້ອຍໆ ຕາມລະດູການ ເພື່ອປົດລັອກປ"
"ະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Don't forget to save your setting changes."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Duplicate the sales tax that applies to your stay offer and rename the "
"duplicate to indicate that it applies locally, e.g. 15% (stay)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາອາກອນຂາຍທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວປ່ຽນຊື່ອັນທີ່ສຳເນົາໃໝ່ ເພື່ອບົ່ງບອກວ່ານຳໃຊ້ພາຍໃນທ້ອງ"
"ຖິ່ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: 15% (ບ່ອນພັກ)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"During an available period, click, drag and drop on a house line to create a "
"slot."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ຫວ່າງ, ໃຫ້ກົດ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງໃສ່ແຖວຂອງເຮືອນພັກ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Each company can have its own website!"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະບໍລິສັດສາມາດມີເວັບໄຊເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Employee assignations"
msgstr "ການມອບໝາຍພະນັກງານ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Employee would open the tasks from their portal access and update the task "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"ພະນັກງານຈະເປີດໜ້າວຽກຈາກໜ້າປະຕູເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Portal) ຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ ແລະ ອັບເດດຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງວຽກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Enforce local tax rate"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Enforcing weekly turnover"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບຮອບວຽນການພັກແບບລາຍອາທິດ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Example: A room for 2 is booked for 4 nights, two guests were here for the "
"first three nights but only one stayed the last night. Then the guests x "
"nights is 2x3+1x1=7."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫ້ອງສຳລັບ 2 ຄົນ ຖືກຈອງໄວ້ 4 ຄືນ, ມີແຂກສອງຄົນພັກໃນສາມຄືນທຳອິດ ແຕ່ເຫຼືອພຽງຄົນດຽວໃນຄືນສຸດທ້"
"າຍ. ສະນັ້ນ ຈຳນວນແຂກ x ຄືນ ແມ່ນ 2x3+1x1=7."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Explore our vacation rentals"
msgstr "ສຳຫຼວດເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Explore stunning properties to discover your next holiday spot."
msgstr "ສຳຫຼວດທີ່ພັກອັນສວຍງາມ ເພື່ອຄົ້ນພົບບ່ອນພັກຜ່ອນໃນວັນພັກຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Find you next holiday house in just a few clicks<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດຫຼັງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດຄລິກ<br/><br/>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Find your dream home"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາບ້ານໃນຝັນຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_11
msgid "Free Cancellation"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການຈອງຟຣີ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_11
msgid ""
"Free cancellation up to 48h prior your stay.<br>50% refund within the 48h."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກຟຣີກ່ອນເວລາເຂົ້າພັກ 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງ.<br>ສົ່ງເງິນຄືນ 50% ຫາກຍົກເລີກພາຍໃນ 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the <strong>Holiday House App</strong>, you can manage your bookings."
"<br/>\n"
"The Holiday House App relies on the Rental and Planning Apps binding, with a "
"few customizations."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ</strong>, ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການການຈອງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້.<br/>\n"
"ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະຫວ່າງແອັບໃຫ້ເຊົ່າ (Rental) ແລະ ແອັບວາງແຜນ "
"(Planning), ໂດຍມີການປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງສ່ວນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the Roles sections, you can select the companies and branches this "
"employee shall have access to as well as the default one."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກພາກສ່ວນ ບົດບາດ (Roles), ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາທີ່ພະນັກງານຜູ້ນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ລວມ"
"ທັງກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the search bar select the Today filter to see to check in and to check "
"out orders."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວກັ່ນຕອງ \"ມື້ນີ້\" (Today) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທີ່ຕ້ອງແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "From there you can add new companies."
msgstr "ຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມບໍລິສັດໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "ສະບາຍດີ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Here you can monitor past and future performance in the books, with overall "
"occupancy, average daily rate, revenue per available room and pickups!"
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຜົນການດຳເນີນງານທັງໃນອະດີດ ແລະ ອະນາຄົດ, ດ້ວຍອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກລວມ, ລາຄາສະ"
"ເລ່ຍຕໍ່ວັນ, ລາຍຮັບຕໍ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ຈຳນວນການຈອງໃໝ່!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_12
msgid "Hobbit House"
msgstr "ເຮືອນຮັອບບິດ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.res_config_settings_form_view_inherited
msgid "Holiday House"
msgstr "ເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If not OK, then click the contact, fill in the Identity section and save the "
"contact."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ກົດໃສ່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່, ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນພາກສ່ວນ ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (Identity) ແລ້ວບັນທຶກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If using the house keeping approver setting, designated\n"
"                    approvers can check each room and set their state to "
"ready to close the tasks."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ອະນຸມັດວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ, ຜູ້ອະນຸມັດທີ່ຖືກມອບໝາຍ\n"
"                    ສາມາດກວດກາແຕ່ລະຫ້ອງ ແລະ ປ່ຽນສະຖານະເປັນ ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ ເພື່ອປິດໜ້າວຽກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to execute a practical guided tour of this module, you should "
"Import demo data and try the Demo - Use Case (In the next Knowledge Article)"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ແບບມີຄຳແນະນຳຕົວຈິງ, ທ່ານຄວນນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ (Demo data) ແລ"
"ະ ທົດລອງ ຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້ (ໃນບົດຄວາມຄວາມຮູ້ຖັດໄປ)"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Image slider"
msgstr "ແຖບສະໄລດ໌ຮູບພາບ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "In any case, the resources are company and branch dependent."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າກໍລະນີໃດກໍຕາມ, ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In any case, you may have written records in journals which are not delete-"
"able and which might be an issue for your traceability."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າກໍລະນີໃດ, ທ່ານອາດມີການບັນທຶກລົງໃນປຶ້ມບັນຊີລາຍວັນເຊິ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການກວດສອບຍ້ອນ"
"ຫຼັງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In case you outsource or rely more heavily on suppliers, the "
"<strong>Purchase App</strong> will help you to manage those aspects."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຈ້າງພາຍນອກ ຫຼື ເພິ່ງພາຜູ້ສະໜອງເປັນຫຼັກ, <strong>ແອັບຈັດຊື້ (Purchase App)</"
"strong> ຈະຊ່ວຍທ່ານຈັດການໃນດ້ານເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"It enables each place manager to adjust the stay offers with greater "
"flexibility without impacting other places."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ຈັດການແຕ່ລະສະຖານທີ່ສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກໄດ້ຢ່າງຄ່ອງຕົວ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສະຖານທີ່ອື່ນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Keep your guests satisfied"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄວາມເພິ່ງພໍໃຈໃຫ້ແກ່ແຂກຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Lastly, replace the tax applied to your stay offers with this new tax."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນແທນອາກອນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍອາກອນໃໝ່ນີ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Leaving a review"
msgstr "ການຂຽນຄຳຕິຊົມ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Let's book a house!"
msgstr "ມາເລີ່ມຈອງເຮືອນພັກກັນເລີຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your accounting easier than ever with a completely integrated "
"environment i<font class=\"text-o-color-5\">n </font>\n"
"            <strong>\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">Accounting App</font>\n"
"            </strong>\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
