#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_12
msgid ""
"Nestled at the edge of wide open fields and a magical forest, this charming "
"hobbit house offers an enchanting stay in nature. With its earth-sheltered "
"design and cozy interior, it’s the perfect hideaway for those seeking peace, "
"simplicity, and a touch of fantasy."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຢູ່ແຄມທົ່ງກວ້າງ ແລະ ປ່າໄມ້ອັນມີສະເໜ່, ເຮືອນຮັອບບິດຫຼັງງາມນີ້ມອບປະສົບການພັກຜ່ອນທ່າມກາງທຳມະຊາດທີ່ແສນ"
"ປະທັບໃຈ. ດ້ວຍການອອກແບບທີ່ກົມກືນກັບພື້ນດິນ ແລະ ພາຍໃນທີ່ອົບອຸ່ນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ສົມບູນແບບສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຊອກ"
"ຫາຄວາມສະຫງົບ, ຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍ ແລະ ກິ່ນອາຍແຫ່ງຈິນຕະນາການ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Next"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_11
msgid "No refund on no-show."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງເງິນຄືນໃນກໍລະນີບໍ່ມາຕາມກຳນົດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that you have several companies or branches, you may want some of your "
"employees to access only to some of them in case they always work in some of "
"your places."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານມີຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພະນັກງານບາງຄົນເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະບາງບ່ອນເທົ່ານັ້"
"ນ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຂົາເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກປະຈຳຢູ່ບາງສະຖານທີ່."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo ມອບຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ຈຳກັດໃຫ້ແກ່ທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test "
"everything around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ມີໃນແພັກເກດນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແອັບໃໝ່, ລຶບ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນ"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ແລະ ທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານທຸກຢ່າງໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On a daily basis, house keeping tasks are created depending on the current "
"stays and assigned to employees that have house keeping shifts."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຕ່ລະວັນ, ວຽກງານແມ່ບ້ານຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມການພັກເຊົາໃນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານ"
"ທີ່ມີກະວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "On a resource to block line, click, drag and drop to create a slot."
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ເທິງແຖວຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປິດກັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກົດ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "On top of guest and stay management, you need to keep the place clean!"
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກການຄຸ້ມຄອງແຂກ ແລະ ການພັກເຊົາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຮັກສາສະຖານທີ່ໃຫ້ສະອາດຢູ່ສະເໝີ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once confirmed, the payment is done and the order booked seamlessly!"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ການຊຳລະເງິນຈະສຳເລັດ ແລະ ການຈອງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກຢ່າງຄ່ອງຕົວ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once defined, you can switch between companies or branches from the company "
"selector at the top right of your screen.<br/>This will expose depending on "
"where you are, only the selected companies and branches data."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາ ຈາກບ່ອນເລືອກບໍລິສັດຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ.<br/>"
"ລະບົບຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນຂອງບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໂດຍອີງຕາມສະຖານະທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once done, loggin as a portal user."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຕູເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Portal)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open a house page from the website and scroll down to the Customer Reviews "
"section."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າເຮືອນພັກຈາກເວັບໄຊ ແລ້ວເລື່ອນລົງໄປຫາພາກສ່ວນ ຄຳຕິຊົມຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open now, the Tasks from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>This "
"is\n"
"                the daily list of house keeping tasks to be tackled."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້, ເປີດໜ້າວຽກ (Tasks) ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ (House Keeping).<br/>ນີ້ຄື\n"
"                ລາຍການວຽກແມ່ບ້ານປະຈຳວັນທີ່ຕ້ອງດຳເນີນການ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the companies from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ບໍລິສັດ ຈາກເມນູ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ &amp; ບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the users from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຈາກເມນູ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ &amp; ບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the <strong>Website App</strong> and navigate to the Houses."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</strong> ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ ເຮືອນພັກ (Houses)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Board from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>Here you "
"have an\n"
"                overview of the cleanness state of your resources."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດກະດານ (Board) ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>ບ່ອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ\n"
"                ພາບລວມຂອງສະຖານະຄວາມສະອາດຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Default pricelist from the configuration menu."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈາກເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Default pricelist to see the existing price rules which apply to it."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດຕາຕະລາງລາຄາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງກົດເກນລາຄາທີ່ມີຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງນຳໃຊ້ກັບຕາຕະລາງນີ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Holiday House App and navigate to the Configuration / Leaves menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ / ການລາພັກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Holiday House App and then navigate to the orders from the menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູໃບສັ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Holiday<strong/> House App to appreciate the currently planned "
"bookings with the Schedule."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກ<strong/>ຕາກອາກາດ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງການຈອງທີ່ໄດ້ວາງແຜນໄວ້ໃນປະຈຸບັນຜ່ານຕາຕະລາງເວລ"
"າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Planning from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>\n"
"                There you can create shifts for house keeping duties and "
"assign employees."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ແຜນງານ (Planning) ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>\n"
"                ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງກະວຽກສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ແມ່ບ້ານ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ພະນັກງານໄດ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Pricelists from the <strong>Holiday House App</strong>, "
"Configuration / Pricelists menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ຕາຕະລາງລາຄາ ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ</strong>, ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ / ຕາຕ"
"ະລາງລາຄາ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Settings App and navigate to the Rental section or search for "
"\"Unavailability days\"."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ ການເຊົ່າ (Rental) ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ \"Unavailability "
"days\"."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Availability."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ Steering ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຄວາມພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (Availability)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Occupancy."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ Steering ແລ້ວເລືອກ ອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ (Occupancy)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Survey App to find the customer satisfaction survey."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບແບບສຳຫຼວດ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາແບບສຳຫຼວດຄວາມເພິ່ງພໍໃຈຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Taxes from the <strong>Invoicing App</strong>, under the "
"Configuration / Accounting menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ອາກອນ ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ</strong>, ພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ / ບັນຊີ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the door for more custom workflows and actions with the power of "
"<strong>Studio App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໂອກາດສູ່ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ "
"<strong>ແອັບ Studio</strong>."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the guest order."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the order of you just arrived guests."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກທີ່ຫາກໍມາຮອດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open your guest order from the Holiday House App."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂອງແຂກຈາກແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Optimizing weekly turnover to maximize occupancy during peak season, you can "
"align your bookings to a weekly rental pattern (e.g., Saturday to Saturday). "
"By restricting check-ins and check-outs to specific days, you synchronize "
"your housekeeping and eliminate calendar gaps."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຮອບວຽນການພັກແບບລາຍອາທິດ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກໃຫ້ສູງສຸດໃນຊ່ວງລະດູທ່ອງທ່ຽວ, ທ່"
"ານສາມາດກຳນົດການຈອງໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຮູບແບບການເຊົ່າລາຍອາທິດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ວັນເສົາ ຫາ ວັນເສົາ). ໂດຍການຈຳ"
"ກັດການແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກສະເພາະວັນທີ່ກຳນົດ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດປະສານງານວຽກແມ່ບ້ານໄດ້ຢ່າງລົງຕົວ ແລ"
"ະ ບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງໃນປະຕິທິນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Plan, check in and and check out bookings with the <strong>Holiday House "
"App</strong>"
msgstr ""
"ວາງແຜນ, ແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກການຈອງ ດ້ວຍ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Prevent bookings year in advance"
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນການຈອງລ່ວງໜ້າເປັນປີ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "ກ່ອນໜ້າ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Promote your offers through the <strong>Website App</strong>"
msgstr "ໂຄສະນາຂໍ້ສະເໜີຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ <strong>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid ""
"Quiet and relaxing atmosphere, warm and cosy house, what a wonderful stay in "
"the hobbit house! I highly recommend!"
msgstr ""
"ບັນຍາກາດງຽບສະຫງົບ ແລະ ຜ່ອນຄາຍ, ເຮືອນພັກອົບອຸ່ນສະບາຍ, ເປັນການພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ຍອດຢ້ຽມຫຼາຍໃນເຮືອນຮັອບບິ"
"ດ! ແນະນຳເລີຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Record guest identity"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງແຂກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Recording the guest attendance is an obligation in numerous countries."
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກການເຂົ້າພັກຂອງແຂກແມ່ນພັນທະທາງກົດໝາຍໃນຫຼາຍໆ ປະເທດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "See All"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງທັງໝົດ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "See all<span class=\"oi ms-2\" data-icon=\"arrow_right\"/>"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງທັງໝົດ<span class=\"oi ms-2\" data-icon=\"arrow_right\"/>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"See that for demo purpose we setup typical uplift and discount rules to "
"adjust your prices during key periods."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າ ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງການສາທິດ ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າກົດເກນການຂຶ້ນລາຄາ ແລະ ສ່ວນຫຼຸດທົ່ວໄປ ເພື່ອປັບລາ"
"ຄາຂອງທ່ານໃນຊ່ວງເວລາສຳຄັນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "See that it contains a rule booking blocker setting price to 0."
msgstr "ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າມັນມີກົດເກນປິດກັ້ນການຈອງ ໂດຍກຳນົດລາຄາເປັນ 0."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select one of your employee."
msgstr "ເລືອກພະນັກງານຂອງທ່ານຄົນໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select or create a customer and then confirm the booking!"
msgstr "ເລືອກ ຫຼື ສ້າງລູກຄ້າ ແລ້ວກົດຢືນຢັນການຈອງ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Selling local products? Use the <strong>Point of Sales App </strong>for easy "
"sales."
msgstr ""
"ຂາຍສິນຄ້າທ້ອງຖິ່ນບໍ່? ໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS) </strong>ເພື່ອການຂາຍທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Setup company or branch specific offers when relevant."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະເພາະຂອງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share your stay offers across your companies and branches (default behavior);"
msgstr ""
"ແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານໄປທົ່ວທຸກບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ (ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ);"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Simply open the Dashboard App to land on the Performance dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ພຽງແຕ່ເປີດ ແອັບແຜງຄວບຄຸມ (Dashboard) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າແຜງຄວບຄຸມປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:holiday_house.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "ຄວາມຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນແບບຍືດຍຸ່ນ (Soft dependency)"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Still from their Rental Order, open the Guests tab."
msgstr "ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າໃບສັ່ງເຊົ່າ (Rental Order), ໃຫ້ເປີດແຖບ ແຂກ (Guests)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_14
msgid ""
"Suspended above the shoreline, this beach house offers sweeping views of the "
"sea and sky. The raw beauty of the landscape meets minimalist comfort, "
"creating an unforgettable retreat where nature feels close, powerful, and "
"ever-present."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໂດດເດັ່ນຢູ່ເໜືອແນວຊາຍຝັ່ງ, ເຮືອນພັກແຄມຫາດຊາຍຫຼັງນີ້ມອບວິວທິວທັດອັນກວ້າງໃຫຍ່ຂອງທະເລ ແລະ ທ້ອງຟ້າ. "
"ຄວາມງົດງາມຕາມທຳມະຊາດປະສານກັບຄວາມສະດວກສະບາຍແບບລຽບງ່າຍ, ສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ໜ້າຈົດຈຳ ເຊິ່ງທ"
"ຳມະຊາດຢູ່ໃກ້ຊິດ, ຊົງພະລັງ ແລະ ໂອບລ້ອມທ່ານຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the availability for you to "
"work on filling in."
msgstr ""
"ແຜນວາດ Gantt ຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍສີ ເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຄວາມພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານວາງແຜນເຕີມເຕັມຫ້ອງຫວ່າ"
"ງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the occupancy, the higher the "
"better."
msgstr ""
"ແຜນວາດ Gantt ຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍສີ ເພື່ອສະແດງເຖິງອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ, ຍິ່ງສູງກໍຍິ່ງດີ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Occupancy view allows you to visualize your \"Sales Success\". It "
"answers one simple question: <i>How well am I filling my holiday houses?</i>"
msgstr ""
"ມຸມມອງອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບ \"ຄວາມສຳເລັດຂອງການຂາຍ\". ເຊິ່ງຕອບຄຳຖາມງ່າຍໆ ຂໍ້ດຽວ"
"ວ່າ: <i>ເຮົາສາມາດເຕີມເຕັມເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດໄດ້ດີສ່ຳໃດ?</i>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The strength of Odoo is to separate the accounting and many other aspects "
"which are company dependent!"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງ Odoo ແມ່ນການແຍກວຽກບັນຊີ ແລະ ດ້ານອື່ນໆ ອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິສັດ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The tasks are assigned to balance cleaning points from the stay offers "
"within employees assigned to the associated house keeping role."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າວຽກຕ່າງໆ ຖືກມອບໝາຍເພື່ອສ້າງຄວາມສົມດຸນຂອງຄະແນນການອະນາໄມ ຈາກຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກ ໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານທີ່ຖື"
"ກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບໜ້າທີ່ແມ່ບ້ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then empty the fiscal position so that the tax applies regardless of your "
"customer's fiscal position."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນປະຊ່ອງສະຖານະທາງອາກອນໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ອາກອນດັ່ງກ່າວ ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສະຖານະທາງອາກອນຂອ"
"ງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then set the days during which you want to prevent check in and check out to "
"take place, ex. All days but Saturday"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນກຳນົດມື້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກ ແລະ ແຈ້ງອອກ, ເຊັ່ນ: ທຸກມື້ຍົກເວັ້ນວັນເສົາ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr ""
"ທັງໝົດນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຟຣີໃນແພັກເກດສະມາຊິກປະຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ; ເຊີນທົດລອງສຳຫຼວດໄດ້ເລີຍ! 🙃"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"They as well share the same pricing, defined at the stay offer level, which "
"has its pros and cons."
msgstr ""
"ພວກມັນຍັງໃຊ້ລາຄາດຽວກັນ ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນລະດັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກ, ເຊິ່ງມີທັງຂໍ້ດີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ເສຍ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "They were happy about their stay, let's ask them to leave a review."
msgstr ""
"ແຂກມີຄວາມສຸກກັບການພັກເຊົາຂອງພວກເຂົາ, ລອງເຊີນຊວນໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຂຽນຄຳຕິຊົມກັນເທາະ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This blocks simulataneously all resources related to this working schedule "
"during the prescribed period."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດກັ້ນທຸກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຕາຕະລາງການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ພ້ອມກັນ ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "This capability is enabled by a setting you can set/unset."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດ/ປິດໄດ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This configuration step may be required to avoid any tax collection "
"inconsistency."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອາດມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງໃນການເກັບອາກອນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup can be used for all products that must keep local tax rates (e.g. "
"late check-in)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກສິນຄ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງຮັກສາອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການແຈ້ງເຂົ້າພັກຊ້າ)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup is relevant in case of place specific offers or when pricing "
"varies between places."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເໝາະສົມໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະເພາະແຕ່ລະສະຖານທີ່ ຫຼື ເມື່ອລາຄາແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະບ່ອນ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time, simply leave a note about the why this is booked and save the "
"slot."
msgstr ""
"ຮອບນີ້, ພຽງແຕ່ຂຽນບັນທຶກເຫດຜົນວ່າເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງມີການຈອງ ແລ້ວບັນທຶກຊ່ອງເວລາໄວ້."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "To benefit from this capability, activate the corresponding setting."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Trace guest attendance"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມການເຂົ້າພັກຂອງແຂກ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_13
msgid ""
"Tucked among tall pine trees, this A-frame cabin is designed for rest, "
"reconnection, and remote living. With natural light, open space, and all the "
"essentials for comfort, it’s a perfect escape for those looking to slow down "
"and recharge in a serene forest setting."
msgstr ""
"ຊ້ອນຕົວຢູ່ທ່າມກາງຕົ້ນສົນສູງສະຫງ່າ, ຕູບໄມ້ຊົງສາມຫຼ່ຽມ (A-frame) ນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອການພັກຜ່ອນ, ການເຊື່"
"ອມໂຍງຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ຊີວິດແບບປົບລີ້ຈາກຄວາມວຸ້ນວາຍ. ດ້ວຍແສງສະຫວ່າງທຳມະຊາດ, ພື້ນທີ່ໂລ່ງກວ້າງ ແລ"
"ະ ສິ່ງອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກທີ່ຈຳເປັນຄົບຖ້ວນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ສົມບູນແບບສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຊີວິດຕາມສະບາຍ "
"ແລະ ຕື່ມພະລັງໃນບັນຍາກາດປ່າໄມ້ອັນສະຫງົບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Two options are now available to you with multiple companies and branches:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ມີສອງທາງເລືອກສຳລັບທ່ານ ເມື່ອມີຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ:"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Type in the customer name in the Schedule search bar filtering by Customer."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ລູກຄ້າລົງໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາຕາຕະລາງເວລາ ໂດຍກັ່ນຕອງຕາມ ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Welcome your guests as well from the Holiday<strong> House App</strong>."
msgstr "ຕ້ອນຮັບແຂກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ</strong>."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When creating an offer, assign them a company or a branch.<br/>As a result, "
"they are available only for the selected company or branch, and will be "
"available only from its website."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາໃຫ້ແກ່ຂໍ້ສະເໜີດັ່ງກ່າວ.<br/>ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະບໍລິສັ"
"ດ ຫຼື ສາຂາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະໃນເວັບໄຊຂອງບໍລິສັດນັ້ນໆ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While Occupancy focuses on what is full, the Availability view focuses on "
"what is left to sell. It is your primary tool for operational safety and "
"\"Scarcity Pricing.\""
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ ອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ ເນັ້ນໃສ່ສິ່ງທີ່ເຕັມແລ້ວ, ມຸມມອງ ຄວາມພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ສິ່ງທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຂາ"
"ຍ. ເຊິ່ງເປັນເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການດຳເນີນງານ ແລະ \"ການກຳນົດລາຄາຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງກ"
"ານສູງ (Scarcity Pricing).\""

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With the create slot for this resource, no overlapping booking slot would be "
"created.<br/>Care about the start and end time or this blockage to make to "
"re-open when suited."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້, ຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາຈອງທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນໄດ້.<br/>ກະລຸນາກວດ"
"ເບິ່ງເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດຂອງການປິດກັ້ນນີ້ ເພື່ອກຳນົດການເປີດຄືນໃໝ່ເມື່ອເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາຫາລືກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ພັດທະນາຂຶ້ນຕື່ມບໍ່?"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You are repairing a house or simply welcoming family and don't want guests "
"to book it?<br/>Alternatively, you are closing for a week during an inter "
"season break?<br/>Let's have this reflected in your schedule!"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານກຳລັງສ້ອມແປງເຮືອນພັກ ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອນຮັບຄອບຄົວ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຂກທົ່ວໄປຈອງແມ່ນບໍ່?<br/>ຫຼື ທ່ານກ"
"ຳລັງຈະປິດໃຫ້ບໍລິການໜຶ່ງອາທິດໃນຊ່ວງປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະດູການ?<br/>ໃຫ້ລະບຸສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນຕາຕະລາງເວລາຂອງທ່ານເລີ"
"ຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆ ແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ ຢູ່ເທິງແຜງຄວບຄຸມຫຼັກ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can as well select your company and in the Branches tab define branches."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ກຳນົດສາຂາໄດ້ໃນແຖບ ສາຂາ (Branches)."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can create an alternative customer satisfaction survey and select it "
"from the Automated Survey settings, as well as configure the email delay as "
"you wish the email to be sent after the guest checkout."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແບບສຳຫຼວດຄວາມເພິ່ງພໍໃຈຂອງລູກຄ້າແບບອື່ນ ແລະ ເລືອກຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແບບສຳຫຼວດອັດຕະໂນມັ"
"ດ, ລວມທັງກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາສົ່ງອີເມວຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ແຂກແຈ້ງອອກແລ້ວ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດສຳເລັດຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້ນີ້ແລ້ວ! ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາຍລ້ານວິທີໃນການປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Odoo ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ"
"ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທຸລະກິດທ່ານ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You could customize this section to add the identity document picture or "
"extra fields at your convenience with studio. Just be careful, such "
"customizations can quickly become messy."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງພາກສ່ວນນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຮູບເອກະສານຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ຕາມສະດວກດ້ວຍ "
"Studio. ພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງ, ເພາະການປັບແຕ່ງດັ່ງກ່າວອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບສັບສົນໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your package and check the related box"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນບໍ່? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ &gt; Industries &gt; "
"Upgrade your package ແລ້ວກວດໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You have a future guest on the line willing to book a house?"
msgstr "ທ່ານມີແຂກກຳລັງຕິດຕໍ່ມາເພື່ອຕ້ອງການຈອງເຮືອນພັກແມ່ນບໍ່?"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You holiday house is online and future guests found it!"
msgstr "ເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດຂອງທ່ານອອນລາຍແລ້ວ ແລະ ແຂກກໍໄດ້ຄົ້ນພົບບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You just installed the Odoo for Holiday House package. By doing so, we have "
"installed a bunch of necessary apps to run your business efficiently."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຫາກໍຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Odoo ສຳລັບເຮືອນພັກຕາກອາກາດ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງບັນດາແອັບທີ່ຈຳເປັ"
"ນຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອດຳເນີນທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may be running multiple places at the same time and most likely be "
"willing to run them all from the same database.<b/>We got you covered with "
"this using multiple companies or branches!"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດກຳລັງດຳເນີນທຸລະກິດຫຼາຍສະຖານທີ່ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຄຸ້ມຄອງທັງໝົດຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັ"
"ນ.<b/>ພວກເຮົາຮອງຮັບສິ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍສາຂາ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may want to uplift your margin during high season and be attractive "
"during low one playing on price.<br/>To do so, let's define price rules."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມກຳໄລໃນຊ່ວງລະດູທ່ອງທ່ຽວ (High season) ແລະ ດຶງດູດລູກຄ້າໃນຊ່ວງໂລຊີຊັນ (Low "
"season) ດ້ວຍການປັບລາຄາ.<br/>ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການດັ່ງກ່າວ, ມາກຳນົດກົດເກນລາຄາກັນເລີຍ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You might have tested this package with or without demo data."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ທົດສອບແພັກເກດນີ້ໂດຍມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You noticed that the Identity Check highlights whether you captured all the "
"necessary information for a guest?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສັງເກດເຫັນບໍ່ວ່າ ການກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດຂອງແ"
"ຂກແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various flows you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຄວນທົດລອງປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປະຕິ"
"ບັດໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວໃນແພັກເກດນີ້ຜ່ານ Odoo."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You welcome your first guests, awesome!"
msgstr "ທ່ານໄດ້ຕ້ອນຮັບແຂກຊຸດທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ຍອດຢ້ຽມຫຼາຍ!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You're now waiting for your guest to arrive."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ແຂກຂອງທ່ານມາຮອດ."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid ""
"Your Dynamic Snippet will be displayed here... This message is displayed "
"because you did not provide both a filter and a template to use.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Dynamic Snippet ຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຢູ່ນີ້... ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສະແດງຂຶ້ນເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດທັງຕົວກັ່ນຕອງ "
"ແລະ ຮູບແບບແມ່ແບບ (Template) ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.<br/>"

